 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Graph isomorphism in quasipolynomial time, in Lean",
  "excerpt": "A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of Babai's quasipolynomial-time algorithm for graph isomorphism, without the classification of finite simple groups, ending in a statement about single-tape Turing machines. The algorithm, its correctness and its running time are proved in Lean, and the machine that runs it is built from the formalized algorithm."
 },
